      "content": "That's a good start, you definitely hit a lot of the main ones. The tone is still professional, which is good. \n\nHowever, I just checked the internal ATS preview tool and the \"term coverage score\" for this version is still a bit lower than I'd like. It's hovering around 65%. For this candidate to actually get noticed by the Tier 1 firms, we really need that score to be closer to 90% or 100%. \n\nCan you try another version? Again, I'm stressing: please don't just dump a list of words at the bottom or make it look like a glossary. It has to remain a cohesive, readable biography that a human recruiter would actually enjoy reading, but we really need to maximize that coverage score to get them through the initial filter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
